+; tree-sitter-pli's in-place build ships no HIGHLIGHTS_QUERY, and its own
+; highlights.scm tags every header keyword (PROC, RETURNS, FIXED...). Only
+; the attributes that say how a procedure behaves count as modifiers:
+; RECURSIVE, REORDER, ... and the OPTIONS list (MAIN, FETCHABLE, ...).
+(procedure_heading (simple_attribute) @keyword.modifier)
+(procedure_heading
+  (options_attribute (paren_group (identifier) @keyword.modifier)))
