@@ -27,6 +27,10 @@ Run `cgr language list-languages` to see every language below, its tier, and whe
 | Rust | Fully Supported | .rs | ✓ | ✓ | ✓ | ✓ | impl blocks, associated functions, macro_rules! macros |
 | TypeScript (TSX) | Fully Supported | .tsx | ✓ | ✓ | ✓ | - | All TypeScript features plus JSX elements and components |
 | TypeScript | Fully Supported | .ts, .mts, .cts | ✓ | ✓ | ✓ | - | Interfaces, type aliases, enums, namespaces, ES6/CommonJS modules |
+| Db2 SQL | In Development | .ddl, .db2 | ✓ | - | ✓ | - | Db2 for z/OS tables and views from CREATE statements as functions; PL/I EXEC SQL statements and views call the tables they name |
+| HLASM | In Development | .mfs, .asm, .hlasm, .mlc | ✓ | - | ✓ | - | IMS MFS formats (FMT) and messages (MSG) as functions, a message calling its SOR format and NXT message; PL/I string literals naming them become calls |
+| JCL | In Development | .jcl, .cntl | ✓ | - | ✓ | - | JOBs and in-stream or cataloged PROCs as functions calling the programs their steps run (PGM=, IMS DFSRRC00 PARM=, MBR=, DSN RUN PROGRAM) and the procedures they execute, INCLUDE members as imports |
+| PL/I | In Development | .pli, .pl1, .pco | ✓ | ✓ | ✓ | - | Procedures, ENTRY points and PACKAGEs (as classes) named by their labels, CALL statements and function references to known procedures, %INCLUDE resolution to members, fixed-format margins blanked before parsing, extensionless z/OS member names (opt-in) |
 | Scala | In Development | .scala, .sc | ✓ | ✓ | ✓ | - | Case classes, objects |
 | SQL (PostgreSQL) | In Development | .sql | ✓ | - | ✓ | - | Stored functions (CREATE FUNCTION), each one a dead-code root, schema-qualified names, invocations between routines, and the DDL that runs a routine by name (trigger EXECUTE FUNCTION, aggregate SFUNC/FINALFUNC, cast WITH FUNCTION, operator FUNCTION, type INPUT/OUTPUT, HANDLER/VALIDATOR, SUPPORT). CREATE PROCEDURE and in-depth PL/pgSQL bodies await upstream grammar support: the published grammar parses plain SQL statements only |
